{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>English localization only available in Demo.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynasty crumbles. The land fractures. You're one of many orphans, taken in by distant kin. On reaching adulthood, you become a constable, whether for survival or ambition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Long Knives</i></strong> is a low-fantasy wuxia text-based adventure with TTRPG mechanics and deep narrative branching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TTRPG-inspired. Second-person narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize attributes. Choose pre-orphan background. Allocate points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proficiencies affect skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses an 18-sided die, not D20.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visible and hidden checks. Reload anytime.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalized Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every line of dialogue is your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story branches respond to hidden variables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cloud saves. All data is local.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3486280?t=1770706088","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770706088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486280/80777a06c0bb4d4d4257b1bef192dfd6d77c778f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770706088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486280/80777a06c0bb4d4d4257b1bef192dfd6d77c778f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770706088","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3529420,"description":"